# Architecture (working log)

> Tracked in git. Living decisions for this repo — not a substitute for `docs/architecture/`.

## Overview

Ledger: research-first long-only liquid equity sleeve toolkit. Public repo + private companion (`ledger-private`) for live holdings. Cadence: Mar/Sep catalog gate → Apr/Oct holdings research.

**Risk is an extra layer on Ledger, not Ledger 2.0.** Core loop stays: strategy family → change bar → holdings actions. Optimizer / VaR sit beside that (MCP + gold → Investing Desk Risk & Mandate). Same book, same cadence, you still click the trades. Do not version-bump or brand 2.0 until an October production screenshot shows those numbers on the desk.

## Data shapes

| Name | Shape / location | Notes |
|------|------------------|-------|
| Holdings | ledger-private `holdings_nordnet.yaml` | Never commit to public repo |
| Research cycle | `reports/research_cycle.*` | Private full detail |
| Public scrub | `dashboard/research/` | No brokers, no absolute € |
| Catalog gate | `reports/catalog_gate.*` | Human approves CANDIDATES/policy |
| Risk layer | `investing.risk` → gold CSV → `12-investing-desk` | Book vs min-vol vs max-Sharpe vs 95% VaR; weights % in public visuals |

