## File structure

```text
investing/
├── configs/          # public policy + examples
├── src/investing/    # CLI + research + review
│   ├── risk/         # mean-variance + VaR (open math)
│   └── mcp_server/   # Cursor tools wrapping risk/
├── dashboard/research/  # public scrub
├── reports/          # private (gitignored HTML/JSON)
├── .cursor/mcp.json  # repo-bound investing-risk stdio server
└── .state/
```

## Design patterns

- Companion resolution via `companion.py` / `LEDGER_PRIVATE_ROOT`
- Selection change bar in `research/selection.py`
- Slack → ingest → commit private main → `invest research` → Orbit `public/ledger-research` (Cursor Automation)
- Risk MCP is query-only (weights/VaR); it does not place orders or write holdings
- A risk object is not shipped until it has pytest + gold table + one Risk & Mandate visual

